# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion: Module-by-Module Parity Assessment
## PART 2: Supply Chain Management (SCM) & Manufacturing
*Page / Form / Field / Granular Level Comparison*

Legend: ✅ = Exists in NexusAI | ⚠️ = Partial / Simplified | ❌ = Missing entirely

---

## Module 10 — Procurement (Purchasing / SQM)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Purchasing + Supplier Qualification Management

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [PurchaseOrders.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PurchaseOrders.tsx) (7.6KB) — PO list with search and status
- ✅ [PurchaseRequisitions.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PurchaseRequisitions.tsx) — PR shopping cart style
- ✅ [RFQs.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/RFQs.tsx) (6.3KB) — Request for Quotation
- ✅ [SupplierManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SupplierManagement.tsx) (8.4KB) — Supplier master
- ✅ [SupplierCollaborationPortal.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SupplierCollaborationPortal.tsx) (12.4KB) — Supplier-facing portal
- ✅ [SupplierQualification.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SupplierQualification.tsx)
- ✅ [ExternalSupplierRegistration.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExternalSupplierRegistration.tsx) (16.9KB)
- ✅ [ThreeWayMatch.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ThreeWayMatch.tsx)
- ✅ [GoodsReceipt.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/GoodsReceipt.tsx) / [GoodsReceiptPutaway.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/GoodsReceiptPutaway.tsx)
- ✅ `procurement/` sub-directory — 3 pages
- ✅ [ProcurementSourcing.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ProcurementSourcing.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Purchase Order (Full Form — Lines, Distributions, Schedules)** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle PO has Line-level splits to multiple Distributions (charge account, project, cost center). Nexus PO lacks the distribution split form. |
| **Blanket Purchase Agreements (BPAs)** | ❌ Missing | Long-term price agreements with suppliers. Orders placed against BPAs auto-inherit price terms. Schema and UI are both missing. |
| **Contract Purchase Agreements (CPAs)** | ❌ Missing | Framework agreements without specific item lines. |
| **Buyer Work Area (Requisition-to-PO)** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle's Buyer Work Area shows exception-based alerts: Unfulfilled PRs, Overdue POs, Price Breaks. Nexus lacks the exception/alerting dashboard. |
| **Punchout Catalog (cXML / OCI)** | ❌ Missing | Shopping on Amazon Business / Staples and importing the cart back into a PR. |
| **Supplier Negotiations (Sourcing)** | ⚠️ Partial | [ProcurementSourcing.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ProcurementSourcing.tsx) exists but Oracle's Negotiation module has structured Bid Rounds, Transformations (sealed bids), and automatic Award processing. |
| **Supplier Performance Scorecards** | ⚠️ Partial | [SupplierQualityScorecard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SupplierQualityScorecard.tsx) exists but lacks KPI weighting engine and benchmarking across suppliers. |
| **Intrastat / Landed Cost (Import)** | ⚠️ Partial | Customs compliance page exists. Missing: Direct integration with PO receipts to apportion customs duty to item cost. |
| **PO Change Orders (Amendment Log)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle tracks every amendment to a PO with version history, requiring re-approval if amount changes exceed thresholds. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (PO Header Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| PO Number / Type (Standard, Blanket, Planned) | ✅ |
| Supplier / Site / Contact | ✅ |
| Ship-To Location | ✅ |
| Bill-To Location | ❌ Missing |
| Pay Site | ❌ Missing |
| Payment Terms | ✅ |
| Buyer | ✅ |
| Note to Supplier | ⚠️ |
| BPA Release Number | ❌ Missing |
| Encumbrance / Funds Check | ❌ Missing |
| Accept / Acknowledge by Date | ❌ Missing |

