## Module 11 — Inventory Management / PIM
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Inventory + Product Information Management

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [Inventory.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Inventory.tsx) (11.3KB) — Main inventory list
- ✅ [ItemDirectory.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ItemDirectory.tsx) (8.8KB) — Item master directory
- ✅ [ItemProfile.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ItemProfile.tsx) (7KB) — Individual item detail  
- ✅ [MaterialMaster.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MaterialMaster.tsx) (4.8KB)
- ✅ [CycleCountingAudit.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CycleCountingAudit.tsx) (6KB)
- ✅ [StockTransfer.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/StockTransfer.tsx) / [StockIssue.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/StockIssue.tsx) / [StockPickingPacking.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/StockPickingPacking.tsx)
- ✅ [BulkInventoryManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BulkInventoryManagement.tsx)
- ✅ `inventory/` — 1-page subdir + extensive [InventoryDashboardView.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/InventoryDashboardView.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Item Master (Multi-Tab — Full Oracle)** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle item master has 10+ organization-specific tabs: Purchasing, Inventory, BOM, Costing, Planning, Receiving, Shipping, WIP, Physical. Nexus has a simpler single-view form. |
| **Item Categories & Catalog Hierarchy** | ⚠️ Partial | Categories exist. Missing: Hierarchical catalog structure (Parent > Child), multi-catalog assignment. |
| **Item Relationships** | ❌ Missing | Substitute items, related items (cross-sell), ATO/PTO model options. |
| **Item Revisions** | ❌ Missing | ECO (Engineering Change Order) driving a controlled revision history on items. |
| **Lot / Serial Control UI (Transactions)** | ⚠️ Partial | Tables exist. Missing: Lot genealogy tree visualization, expiry date tracking, quarantine holds. |
| **Min-Max Planning Setup** | ❌ Missing | Setting Min Stock / Max Stock per item/subinventory so MRP can auto-generate replenishment suggestions. |
| **Locator Control (Bin-Level)** | ⚠️ Partial | Present but lacks the picking-sequence ordering used by WMS to direct warehouse operators. |
| **Material Status Controls** | ❌ Missing | Active / Hold / Quarantine / Obsolete statuses that block or restrict transactions on an item at a specific locator. |
| **Unit of Measure Conversions** | ⚠️ Partial | UOM exists. Missing: Inter-class conversions (e.g., "5 gallons = 1 jug") and item-specific conversion overrides. |

