## Module 12 — Warehouse Management (WMS)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle WMS Cloud (LogFire / Warehouse Management)

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [Warehouse.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Warehouse.tsx) (10KB) — Main warehouse dashboard
- ✅ [GoodsReceiptPutaway.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/GoodsReceiptPutaway.tsx) (6.2KB)
- ✅ `wms/` sub-directory — 6 pages
- ✅ [YardDockManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/YardDockManagement.tsx) (5.9KB)
- ✅ Schema: [scm.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/scm.ts) contains wms_waves, wms_handling_units, wms_strategies

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Directed Putaway Rules** | ❌ Missing | Rules engine (item category + zone capacity + temperature zone) dictating which bin an operator must deposit goods into. |
| **Wave Planning / Outbound Release** | ❌ Missing | Grouping outbound orders into efficient "waves" based on zone, carrier, ship window. No execution engine exists. |
| **RF Scanner Task Manager UI** | ❌ Missing | Mobile-optimized scanner screens: Receive PO, Putaway, Pick, Pack, Ship Confirm. These are the core WMS UIs Oracle relies on for floor operations. |
| **LPN (License Plate Number) Management** | ⚠️ Partial | Schema exists (`wms_handling_units`). No UI to scan/create/split/merge LPNs. |
| **Task Interleaving Engine** | ❌ Missing | Algorithm alternating putaway tasks with picking tasks to eliminate wasted operator travel. |
| **Cross-Docking** | ❌ Missing | Routing incoming goods directly to outbound orders without bin storage. |
| **Pack Station UI** | ❌ Missing | Step-by-step screen for packing operators: Scan item, select container, print label, close carton. |
| **Carrier Manifesting (Ship Confirm)** | ⚠️ Partial | [ShipmentPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ShipmentPlanning.tsx) exists. Missing: Rate shopping between carriers, manifest printing, BOL generation. |

