## Module 13 — Manufacturing / WIP (Discrete & Process)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Manufacturing (FusionApp + WIP Cloud)

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ `manufacturing/` sub-directory — 24 pages
- ✅ [BOMRouting.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BOMRouting.tsx) — BOM and routing viewer
- ✅ [WIPTracking.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/WIPTracking.tsx) / [WIPTrackingDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/WIPTrackingDashboard.tsx)
- ✅ [BatchManufacturing.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BatchManufacturing.tsx) / [BatchOrdersManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BatchOrdersManagement.tsx) (for process mfg)
- ✅ [ShopFloor.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ShopFloor.tsx) / [ShopFloorDataCollection.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ShopFloorDataCollection.tsx)
- ✅ [ProductionPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ProductionPlanning.tsx) / [ProductionSchedulingGantt.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ProductionSchedulingGantt.tsx)
- ✅ [MRPDashboardFull.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MRPDashboardFull.tsx) / [MRPMPSPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MRPMPSPlanning.tsx)
- ✅ [FormulationRecipeManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/FormulationRecipeManagement.tsx)
- ✅ Schema: Comprehensive (`bom`, `routings`, `production_orders`, `mrp_plans`, `mrp_recommendations`)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Visual BOM Designer (Drag-and-Drop)** | ⚠️ Partial | BOMRouting exists but Oracle has a visual tree-expansion designer. Missing: Effectivity dates on BOM components, multi-level phantom assembly handling. |
| **Work Execution (Shop Floor UI)** | ⚠️ Partial | ShopFloorDataCollection.tsx exists. Missing: Oracle's dispatcher-to-operator real-time task screen. Operators scan job number, see operation steps, report quantities per step. |
| **Outside Processing (OSP) Integration** | ❌ Missing | Sending a sub-assembly to an external supplier (via PO) for a processing operation and receiving it back. |
| **MRP Engine — Execution (Run Plan)** | ⚠️ Partial | MRP tables and UI exist. Missing: The actual recursive BOM explosion + demand netting algorithm that populates mrp_recommendations. |
| **Supply Chain Event Management** | ❌ Missing | Oracle alerts planners when demand changes threaten a Planned Order (e.g. supplier lead time increase). |
| **Finite Capacity Scheduling** | ❌ Missing | Oracle can constrain the schedule to available machine/labor capacity and shift production orders accordingly. |
| **SCORM-Based Work Instructions** | ❌ Missing | Attaching training videos/documents to operation steps for operator guidance. |

