| **Failure Code / FMEA Catalog** | ⚠️ Partial | [maintenance_failure.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/maintenance_failure.ts) schema exists. Missing: Full FMEA (Failure Mode Effects Analysis) UI tree. |

