### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Financial Project Manager Dashboard** | ⚠️ Partial | Budget vs Actuals exists conceptually. Missing: Real-time EVM metrics (CPI, SPI, EAC) displayed in a project control dashboard. |
| **Expenditure Entry & Approval** | ⚠️ Partial | Timesheet entry exists. Missing: Non-labor expenditure batches (materials, travel) with project-level approval. |
| **Project Costing Processor (Burdening)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle applies overhead/burden rates to raw project costs via the Project Cost Processor (a background engine). |
| **Project Billing Engine** | ❌ Missing | Oracle generates draft project invoices from unbilled expenditures based on billing actions/events. |
| **Funding Sources (Grants)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle tracks external funding agreements and automatically applies them as cost offsets. |
| **Cross-Charge / Borrowed Resources** | ❌ Missing | When a resource in BU-A works on a project in BU-B, Oracle generates IC cross-charge transactions automatically. |
| **Time & Labor → Project Integration** | ⚠️ Partial | Timesheets exist. Missing: Automatic push of approved project timesheets into the PPM Expenditure Cost Processor. |
